"""XGL5030-472MEC - 4.7 uH 20 % shielded power inductor, Coilcraft XGL5030 (5.28 x 5.48 x 3.1 mm). Bare part.

Datasheet: Coilcraft XGL5030 series, Document 1576 (revised 02/19/26), the URL in pcb.toml.
Role: the series choke of the fan motor behind the STSPIN958 at 400 kHz (next-revision proposal,
Fan): 4.7-10 uH, Isat at or above the REF current limit (up to 5 A), about 5 x 5 mm.

Electrical (Doc 1576-2 table, XGL5030-472ME_ row; notes):
- L 4.7 uH +-20 % at 1 MHz.
- DCR 21.9 mOhm typ, 24.5 mOhm max. SRF 23 MHz typ.
- Isat 3.1 A (10 % drop), 4.8 A (20 % drop), 6.7 A (30 % drop), DC at 25 C.
- Irms 6.3 A (20 C rise) and 8.5 A (40 C rise) from 25 C ambient.
- Ambient -40 to +125 C with the 40 C-rise Irms (Doc 1576-1). Mass 0.46-0.52 g (Doc 1576-1).
- Operating voltage 80 V (Doc 1576-1, note 7), above the 17.4 V 4S pack.
At a 5 A limit the inductance is down by a little more than 20 % (about 3.7 uH): still in the
fan study's range; above 6.7 A it falls by more than 30 %.

Dimensions (part-page drawing): 5.28 +-0.2 x 5.48 +-0.2 mm, height 3.1 mm max for the -472
(height table); bottom terminals 1.0 +-0.05 mm wide, 2.31 +-0.25 mm apart, 4.2 mm long typ.
Recommended land pattern: 1.18 x 4.70 mm pads at 3.31 mm centre pitch, the same as the XAL5030
(Coilcraft XAL50xx drawing). The bar on the top marks the start (short) lead: "Connect high
dv/dt here for lowest EMI".

Under DC bias (Coilcraft's saturation SPICE model of the part, XGL5030-472_sat: L 4.4984 uH, Is
13.0461 A, a 0.7097) the incremental inductance keeps 92 / 87 / 81 / 77 / 66 % of its zero-current
value at 2 / 3 / 4 / 4.8 / 6.7 A, slightly below the datasheet's 10 / 20 / 30 % points. AC (core)
loss from Coilcraft's power-inductor loss tool for this part: 71.6 mW x dIpp^1.99 at 0.408 MHz,
independent of the DC current and linear in frequency; part temperature rise 25.3 K/W (same
tool; research calculations/fan/fan_choke_check.py).

The `current` property is the lower of the 40 C-rise Irms and the 30 %-drop Isat, as for the
other inductor packages in this registry.
"""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Current", "Inductance", "Resistance")
load("@stdlib/utils.zen", "format_value")

P1 = io(Net)
P2 = io(Net)

# Doc 1576-2, XGL5030-472ME_ row.
inductance = Inductance("4.7uH 20%")
isat = Current("6.7A")  # 30 % drop, 25 C
isat_20 = Current("4.8A")  # 20 % drop
irms = Current("8.5A")  # 40 C rise; 6.3 A at 20 C rise
current = Current("6.7A")
dcr = Resistance("24.5mOhm")  # max; 21.9 mOhm typ

Component(
    name="XGL5030-472",
    prefix="L",
    symbol=Symbol(library="XGL5030-472.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("L_Coilcraft_XAL5030-XXX.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="XGL5030-472MEC", manufacturer="Coilcraft"),
    pins={"1": P1, "2": P2},
    properties={
        "value": format_value(inductance, current),
        "inductance": inductance,
        "current": current,
        "isat": isat,
        "isat_20": isat_20,
        "irms": irms,
        "dcr": dcr,
    },
    type="inductor",
)
